Package: saferGraph
Type: Package
Title: Device, Axis and Tick Tools for Base R Graphics
Version: 1.0.0
Date: 2026-10-14
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = "Haiding", family = "Wang", role = "ctb"),
    person(given = "Yushi", family = "Han", role = "ctb"),
    person(given = "Mia", family = "Legras", role = "ctb"),
    person(given = "Gael", family = "Millot",  email = "gael.millot@pasteur.fr", role = c("cre", "aut", "ctb"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-0591-3509"))
  )
Encoding: UTF-8
Maintainer: Gael Millot <gael.millot@pasteur.fr>
Description: Set of functions for base R graphics, written according to the safer-r project recommendations (see <https://github.com/safer-r>): opening of a PDF or screen graphic device that returns the initial graphic parameters, closing of specific kinds of graphic devices, redrawing of the axes of a plot (log scale, qualitative axis, secondary ticks, grid and background color) with coordinates for legends and additional text, selection of nice tick values for an axis range, and coordinates and values of secondary ticks. This includes strict checking of argument values, explicit package namespace qualification of all the called functions and explicit writing of all their arguments, among other things.
URL: https://github.com/safer-r/saferGraph, https://safer-r.github.io/saferGraph/
BugReports: https://github.com/safer-r/saferGraph/issues
License: GPL-3
